@startuml
title UC-01 - Create Application
autonumber
actor Developer as Dev
boundary ApplicationController as API
control ApplicationService as Service
control ExecutionTargetResolver as TargetResolver
database ConnectionRepository as ConnectionRepo
database ApplicationRepository as AppRepo
database EnvironmentRepository as EnvRepo
database DeploymentSetRepository as SetRepo

Dev -> API: ListApplicationConnections(session Organization)
API -> ConnectionRepo: ListReadySupported(organizationID)
ConnectionRepo --> API: safe choices + Organization default key
API --> Dev: select default or another READY connection
Dev -> API: CreateApplication(name, subdomain, connectionKey?) [MS-01]
API -> Service: CreateApplication(ctx, command)
Service -> Service: Validate name/subdomain [MS-02]
Service -> TargetResolver: Resolve(organizationID, connectionKey?) [MS-03]
TargetResolver --> Service: selected target; default only if key omitted
Service -> ConnectionRepo: FindReady(organizationID, target.connectionID)
ConnectionRepo --> Service: Connection
Service -> Service: Application.Create(generatedID, target) [MS-04]
Service -> Service: Create staging/production\nDeploymentSet.Empty()\nNamespaceIdentity.ForEnvironment() [MS-05..MS-06]
Service -> Service: Derive desired endpoints [MS-07]
Service -> AppRepo: Save(application) <<transaction>>
Service -> EnvRepo: Save(staging, production) <<transaction>>
Service -> SetRepo: SaveAndSetCurrent(emptySets) <<transaction>>
SetRepo --> Service: Application context
Service --> API: Application + Environments [MS-08]
API --> Dev: Created
@enduml
